Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: toybox multi-call binary (all applets)
 toybox is a single multi-call binary implementing common Unix utilities.
 .
 This package installs the dynamically linked /system/bin/toybox plus one
 symbolic link per applet, so all of its commands are available from
 /system/bin. Runtime dependencies are generated from the binary's ELF
 NEEDED entries (bionic provides libc/libm/libdl).
